   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Rifinanziamento Fondo Bilaterale Emergenza presso CICR/ICRC II tranche 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Contributo volontario per l&apos;anno 2023 per il rifinanziamento del Fondo Bilaterale Emergenza in essere presso ICRC per il finanziamento di interventi umanitari in risposta a calamit&#xE0; naturali o causate dall&apos;uomo.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary contribution 2023 to ICRC-Italy Bilateral Emergency Fund to support humanitarian interventions related to unforeseeable emergencies caused by both man-made and natural disasters and to any event in which there is a clear threat to the survival of human life.</narrative>
